        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are writing about your support case, &lt;strong&gt;{!$Record.CaseNumber}&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have placed your case &lt;strong&gt;On Hold&lt;/strong&gt; for now and today is day &lt;strong&gt;{!CurrentDay}&lt;/strong&gt;. We need more information from you before we can fix the problem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please reply with the details below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detailed Explanation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steps to reproduce error&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your case will stay on hold until we get this information. Once you reply, our team will start working on it again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If we do not hear from you in &lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!RemainingDaysNumber}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;days, we may close this case. You can always open a new one if you still need help.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your help,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!$Record.Account.Name}&lt;/p&gt;</text>
